                "**Make it visible.** Put each limit in the column header, highlight columns that are at or over their limit, and write the policies on or beside the board.",
                "**Run for two to four weeks, then review.** Track cycle time, throughput, blocked items and every limit breach. Adjust one or two limits at your next retrospective or operations review.",
