            "Count blocked items towards the limit. If you do not, a column can fill with blocked work while new items keep arriving, and the limit stops doing its job. Counting them creates healthy pressure to resolve blockers. Mark blocked cards clearly, note the reason and date, and review patterns regularly; [blocker clustering](/project-management/kanban/blocker-clustering/) is a simple way to find the causes that recur.",
            H3("Urgent work and breaching a limit"),
